    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "NCEI Accession 0143635 includes discrete sample and profile data collected from Kaiyo in the Philippine Sea from 1994-02-12 to 1994-02-16. These data include DELTA CARBON-14, DISSOLVED OXYGEN, HYDROSTATIC PRESSURE, NITRATE, NITRITE, Potential temperature (theta), SALINITY, WATER TEMPERATURE, phosphate and silicate. The instruments used to collect these data include CTD and bottle.\n\nThese data were collected by Kei Muneyama of Japan Agency for Marine-Earth Science and Technology (JAMSTEC) as part of the GLODAPv2_49XK19940212 data set. CDIAC assigned the following cruise ID(s) to this data set: GLODAPv2_49XK19940212",
